[freehsm-c] FATAL : the secure heap could not be created.
  Asked for 65536 kB (secure_heap_kb in /etc/freehsm/freehsm.conf,
  default 8192 kB).
  OpenSSL could not allocate it at all.
  Your locked-memory limit is 8192 kB (ulimit -l). The arena must
  fit inside it -- raising secure_heap_kb alone does not give you
  a bigger arena, it stops the module. Raise both, or neither.
